{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52532","headline":"修文语土民 · 陈元光","name":"修文语土民","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庙算符天象，干旄格有苗。\n三军歌按堵，万骑弛鸣镖。\n虔岭顽民远，朝阳寇逆招。\n偃文休衆士，锡命自皇朝。\n莫篆天然石，惟吹洛下箫。\n声闻神起舞，气感海无妖。\n方叔猷元壮，相如赋未饶。\n成周放牛马，林野任逍遥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52532.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52532","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}